- operation_key: logic.cmdb.service|POST|/v2/object/{objectId}/olap
  method: POST
  path: /v2/object/{objectId}/olap
  raw_paths:
    backend: /v2/object/:objectId/olap
    frontend: ''
  path_source: backend_contract
  path_confidence: high
  service: logic.cmdb.service
  request:
    fields:
    - name: objectId
      type: object_id
      desc: 模型对象ID
    - name: instance_filter
      type: map
      desc: instance_filter
    - name: metrics_filter
      type: map
      desc: metrics_filter
    - name: fields
      type: string[]
      desc: 指定返回字段
    - name: sort
      type: object[]
      desc: 按字段排序
    - name: page
      type: page
      desc: 页码
    - name: page_size
      type: page_size
      desc: 页大小
    - name: time_range
      type: object
      desc: time_range
    - name: measures
      type: CmdbMeasure[]
      desc: measures
    - name: group_fields
      type: string[]
      desc: group_fields
    - name: with_empty_data
      type: bool
      desc: 指标数据查询
    - name: having
      type: map
      desc: having
    - name: minimum_step
      type: string
      desc: minimum_step
    - name: resolution_offset
      type: int64
      desc: 汇聚时相对于UTC偏移量，单位ms。比如需要按照本地时间偏移：8 * 3600 * 1000（加8小时），如果需要按照start_time偏移，可以设置为start_time
    - name: fields_relation_filter
      type: map
      desc: '为 key -> filter, 其中key必须为关系（支持多层）或者边属性@结尾，filter语法同上面的实例filter。 如: APP
        <-cluster---app-> CLUSTER <-host---cluster-> HOST 中 支持： {"cluster": {"$or":[{"name":"aaa"},{"ip":"1"}]},"cluster.@":{"name":"aaa","ctime":"xxx"},"cluster.host":{...}}
        上面过滤，则获取的数据只包含cluster名字为aaa或者ip为1 的 同时边属性满足上面的条件的（目前边属性仅支持 and 逻辑，不支持 or 逻辑），cluster.host同理。
        不支持：{"cluster.name":"aaa"}，key只能为关系的out_id 或者 多层out_id，最后一层支持.@表示该关系上的边属性。'
  response:
    fields:
    - name: total
      type: int
      desc: 实例总数
    - name: page
      type: page
      desc: 页码
    - name: page_size
      type: page_size
      desc: 页大小
    - name: resolution
      type: int
      desc: resolution
    - name: records
      type: object[]
      desc: records
  semantic_gaps: []
  port: 8079
  source_file: FLOW_BUILDER_API_CONTRACT@EASYOPS.json
